This testdef is used in tests that couple MPAS-Ocean with MALI. It sets
    config_land_ice_flux_mode = 'active'
so that MPAS-Ocean computes ice-shelf melt fluxes itself, and it turns off
the SSH consistency check with
    config_check_ssh_consistency = .false.

It also sets
    config_glc_ice_shelf_coupling_import_geometry = .false.
because the oQU240wLI ice-shelf cavities are not consistent with MALI's
ais8to30 ice geometry, so MPAS-Ocean keeps its own land-ice pressure and
fractions and only exchanges ice-shelf fluxes and the interface
temperature with MALI.

It also aligns the DATM and DROF forcing years with a 2000-01-01 start date.
